table inet web {
  chain input {
    type filter hook input priority 0; policy drop;
    iif "lo" accept
    ct state established,related accept
    tcp dport 443 accept
    ip saddr 192.168.50.0/24 tcp dport 22 accept
    ip saddr 10.0.0.0/8 udp dport 53 accept
  }
}
```
Load it with `nft -f web.nft`. In this case rule order doesn't change the outcome, because no two accept rules overlap in a way that matters.
